Cell["\<\
Vertex tooltips show the canonical states. The function gives a Failure for \
an unknown candidate or a candidate without a stored states graph.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->93331280,ExpressionUUID->"d8f357b8-3067-ec40-86b9-8106bb23419f"],

Cell["\<\
It uses only the data stored in the result; nothing is evolved or evaluated \
again.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->396640010,ExpressionUUID->"71f4b677-021f-a04a-9555-eaa54aeb263b"]
}, Open  ]],

